  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FORB_MENA 2026-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FORB_MENA 2026-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A regional FORB- project, implemented by the organization Adyan, with the title &#x201c;Protecting and valuing diversity and intercommunal trust in Lebanon, Iraq and Syria&#x201d;, with the following overall objective: &#x201c;Social cohesion is strengthened across Lebanon, Iraq and Syria through increased inter-faith collaboration, inclusive citizenship, and respect for religious and cultural diversity&#x201d;. The proposal is a two-year project, with a total budget of 4 MSEK, to be disbursed evenly over the course of two years.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett regionalt FORB-projekt, genomf&#xf6;rt av organisationen Adyan, med titeln &quot;Skydda och v&#xe4;rdera m&#xe5;ngfald och inter-kommunalt f&#xf6;rtroende i Libanon, Irak och Syrien&quot;, med f&#xf6;ljande &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l: &quot;Social sammanh&#xe5;llning st&#xe4;rks i Libanon, Irak och Syrien genom &#xf6;kat interreligi&#xf6;st samarbete, inkluderande medborgarskap och respekt f&#xf6;r religi&#xf6;s och kulturell m&#xe5;ngfald&quot;. F&#xf6;rslaget &#xe4;r ett tv&#xe5;&#xe5;rigt projekt med en total budget p&#xe5; 4 MSEK, som ska f&#xf6;rdelas j&#xe4;mnt &#xf6;ver tv&#xe5; &#xe5;r.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Social cohesion is strengthened across Lebanon, Iraq and Syria through increased inter-faith collaboration, inclusive citizenship, and respect for religious and cultural diversity.

Outcome 1: Religious leaders and faith-based actors sustain structured inter-faith collaboration to address shared community challenges and promote the common good

Outcome 2: Intercommunal solidarity is strengthened and celebrated.

Outcome 3: Legal, religious, and social actors apply FoRB principles to support social cohesion.</narrative>
  </description>
